agents-orchestrator release v7.20.0 (tag v7.20.0, commit b5c1cc7bad558f33b9030078e53415be5d6fccc6, T-120 slice 3 superleader writes), /agent/v1 paths only (method, operationId and, when the operation declares any, its query parameter names). Re-vendored from its openapi.json: for each path starting with /agent/v1 write {"paths": {path: {method: {"operationId": id, "query": [sorted query parameter names, omitted when none]}}}} with sorted keys and indent 1.
